    C. napi DTO surface (`ql-bindings-node/src/lib.rs`)
    
      1. New `FunctionMetadataJson` `#[napi(object)]` mirror — all flat
         primitives or strings (per the engine's `#[serde(rename_all =
         "snake_case")]` discipline). The only nested union is `arity:
         ArityJson`.
    
      2. New `ArityJson` tagged-union DTO. `kind: "fixed" | "range" |
         "variadic"` + per-variant `n: Option<u32>` / `min` / `max`. Mirrors
