      3. Enum-string mappers (6 enums, in both directions):
         `volatility_{from,to}_str`, `dep_shape_{from,to}_str`,
         `batch_shape_{from,to}_str`, `arg_policy_{from,to}_str`,
         `cancellation_{from,to}_str`, `arg_context_{from,to}_str`. Unknown
         JS-input strings surface `[bad_argument]` errors (No-Fallbacks; never
         a silent default). The Rust→JS direction is total (every Rust value
         maps to a string).
    
      4. `function_metadata_from_json` / `function_metadata_to_json` — full
