      `ensure_readable`).
    
      Note for future contributors: napi-rs `Option<T>` fields require the
      field to be ABSENT (undefined) rather than `null` — passing `null`
      triggers a `NumberExpected` at the boundary. So the `variadic` Arity
      omits `n`/`min`/`max` rather than setting them to `null`. Documented at
      the test fixture.
    
