    - `extensions/quantlab/src/quantbook/session.ts` —
      `KNOWN_QUANTBOOK_ERROR_CODE_RECORD` gains the same two keys (the
      derived `KNOWN_QUANTBOOK_ERROR_CODES` Set + `ALL_QUANTBOOK_ERROR_CODES`
