   245	    /// An open transaction holds **no engine lock** — it is a pure DTO buffer; the
   246	    /// workbook is untouched until commit, so interleaved single edits between
   247	    /// `begin` and `commit` are allowed and the buffer is validated against the
   248	    /// workbook state *at commit time* (the no-borrow-across-FFI contract §3.4).
   249	    /// **v1 limitation:** grows unbounded (one entry per open txn; dropped on
