   428	    /// Loro commit, so they do NOT use this — and as of the inc.2c (F10) fix,
   429	    /// `rename_table`/`rename_column` now ALSO emit a single `Op::BatchCommit`
   430	    /// (one commit), so this wrapper is **defense-in-depth, not load-bearing**:

