   241	    /// **Phase 6.1B inc.2 (2026-05-26) — session-owned plan cache.**
   242	    /// Construct a runtime that takes ownership of a caller-supplied
   243	    /// `PlanCache` (instead of allocating a fresh one) AND attaches both
   244	    /// an op-log and a calcgraph session. The owning `WorkbookSession`
   245	    /// (`crate::session::WorkbookSession`) holds the long-lived
   246	    /// `PlanCache` and threads it through a per-edit runtime via this
   247	    /// constructor + [`into_plan_cache`], so the cache (and its
   248	    /// hit/miss stats) survive across edits even though the runtime
   249	    /// borrow window is reconstructed per command.
   250	    ///
   251	    /// This is the bottom-up realization of GAP-PS-09 / `docs/api/
   252	    /// session-api.md` §2.1 LOW-1: WorkbookSession owns
   253	    /// `Workbook + OpLog + CalcgraphSession + PlanCache + FunctionRegistry`
